#
# Xtrabackup SST with validate_password on a strict policy.
# Post-processing recreates mysql.pxc.sst.user with a password that would not
# satisfy the policy (aA!9 + 32 random alnum in wsrep_sst_common.sh).
# SST and post-processing succeed anyway: CREATE USER runs from init-file
# before validate_password is active in the temporary post-processing mysqld.
#

--source galera_sst_validate_password.inc
